{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"The note reads as follows\n*'...Without word,\nSeldom heard,\nBanderhobbs creep\nFrom shadows deep\nIn voiceless night\nWhen stars alight\nUpon the bleak and moonless blight...*'","created_at":"2021-07-19T16:16:38.308000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866715165767368724","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"He will fold up the note and give Malathor another nod.","created_at":"2021-07-19T16:18:03.950000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866715524975820830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
